sideling:
adv. Sidelong; on the side; laterally; also, obliquely;
   askew.
a. Inclining to one side; directed toward one side; sloping;
   inclined; as, sideling ground.

sutratman:
Sutratman
(Hinduism) "The String Soul", the "Thread-Self", The cosmic soul, one aspect of the cosmic supreme being;
The soul's consciousness-stream.
